:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[Li'l Dark Cat (Enemy)]]''
'''Li'l Axe Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Lucky Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]] increases health, range and attack power, as well as changing its targeted trait to [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

